{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55263","headline":"怀荆州诸友 · 龚霖","name":"怀荆州诸友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王粲南游後，年年事转新。\n应无故国梦，谁怨武陵春。\n信杳愁归鴈，书成问去人。\n中心不可寄，绿水与红尘。\n（影印本《诗渊》第一册第二四五页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"龚霖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}